# Port policy:
# - preserve 1.20.1 mappings/behavior where version-native;
# - forward-port modern 2.7.x mod-owned features instead of downgrading to 1.2.22;
# - audit the live 2.7.2 delta before freeze;
# - treat Critical Strike as optional/compile integration unless runtime code proves otherwise;
# - adapt Accessories-specific implementation to a native Forge 1.20.1-compatible seam without
#   inventing a new hard public dependency unless behavior truly requires one;
# - certify dedicated server + native client + restart/config/state + deterministic release.
